plain 5 2834bb3006ab7d6e b014d69009da1c09 A one-word line. And another; plus "quoted text" inside.
plain 6 728f21eaf9ed5225 291ed59cd4f7b37e Rzeczpospolita, naiveté, 42% of 3.14159, and Mr O'Brien-Smith Jr.
plain 7 483adf45a046c51c 0cbef8ceca1c8cc2 He said: don't! Then (parenthetically) 1/2 + 3/4 = 5/4; see p. 12.
plain 8 7377f8a434195c98 4c1402534b45dc75 A 5,000-strong crowd raised 1,000,500 dollars, and the fund reached 25,000,000.
plain 9 986658ecb29ddb75 a7930dfa77a7a219 Windows10 and teamtalk5 are words with a version, and MP3, utf8 and H2O are spelled.
plain 10 7afa240e60c15b36 345a4ca9b0e2c20b Call this(thing) or sum(x) for each friend(s), item#3 at price$5, and AUD$5 too.
